# kind | name | source (on-disk LICENSE path for shards; for clib/runtime, an
# SPDX id of licenses-spdx/, or the path of the library's own license file)
#
# Only what the released binary actually embeds. donico has no runtime shard
# at all (stdlib only), and ameba is a mise tool that never ends up in it.
#
# The clib list follows the stdlib modules the tool requires:
#   Regex                      -> pcre2
#   YAML                       -> libyaml
#   GC, static libc, runtime   -> boehm-gc, musl, libgcc
# No openssl (donico does no HTTP or TLS) and no zlib (no Compress module).
# CONFIRMED on 2026-11-17 against the static link line of this very binary,
# captured with `crystal build --static --release --no-debug --verbose` in the
# image crystalreleaser generates for its docker builds (alpine:3.24, Alpine's
# crystal 1.20.3), on linux/amd64 and on linux/arm64, identical:
#   cc _main.o3.o -o donico -rdynamic -static -L/usr/bin/../lib/crystal
#      -lyaml -lpcre2-8 -pthread -lpthread -lgc -lpthread -ldl
# (+ musl and libgcc, which cc links without a flag). The libraries are the ones
# apk records in that image: pcre2 10.49 BSD-3-Clause, yaml 0.2.5 MIT, musl
# 1.2.6 MIT, gc 8.2.12 Boehm-GC, libgcc 15.2.0. This list is crystalreleaser's
# own, minus its OpenSSL and zlib entries. Re-run the check when a stdlib
# module is added or the image moves.
#
# The list is the one of the static Linux binaries, and a superset for the
# darwin ones, which embed the same notices. Those are linked dynamically
# against libSystem and libiconv only (otool -L) and carry neither musl nor
# libgcc; their pcre2, libgc and libyaml are the ones the Crystal that mise
# installs embeds, at other versions (pcre2 10.42, gc 8.2.0, yaml 0.1.6 for
# Crystal 1.20.3, read from its embedded/lib/pkgconfig/*.pc on 2026-11-18),
# under the same licenses.
#
# MIT and BSD-3-Clause require the copyright notice to be reproduced, and their
# SPDX text only has a blank there: those three libraries embed their own
# license file, taken from their sources at the versions above:
#   pcre2    LICENCE.md  github.com/PCRE2Project/pcre2  tag pcre2-10.49
#   libyaml  License     github.com/yaml/libyaml        tag 0.2.5
#   musl     COPYRIGHT   git.musl-libc.org/cgit/musl    tag v1.2.6
clib    | pcre2           | licenses-upstream/pcre2.txt
clib    | libyaml         | licenses-upstream/libyaml.txt
clib    | boehm-gc        | Boehm-GC
clib    | musl            | licenses-upstream/musl.txt
clib    | libgcc          | GCC-runtime-exception
runtime | crystal         | Apache-2.0
project | donico          | LICENSE
